{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":3,"author":{"id":"607ac2a9afabc0e44debe80e34283e413e009770"},"timestamp":1531398391,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwNDQ5NDY5MQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2694#issuecomment-404494691"},"message":"To convert an existing repo over to a dataset, you can use `datalad create --force .`  That doesn't do anything destructive:\n\n```bash\n%\u003e git log --oneline HEAD~2..\n0ec8e34 (HEAD -\u003e master) [DATALAD] new dataset\n6a7b90c [DATALAD] Set default backend for all files to be MD5E\n\n%\u003e git diff HEAD~2\ndiff --git a/.datalad/.gitattributes b/.datalad/.gitattributes\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..c144473\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.datalad/.gitattributes\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+config annex.largefiles=nothing\n+metadata/aggregate* annex.largefiles=nothing\n+metadata/objects/** annex.largefiles=(largerthan=20kb)\ndiff --git a/.datalad/config b/.datalad/config\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..673c119\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.datalad/config\n@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@\n+[datalad \"dataset\"]\n+       id = b8eaeee4-85cd-11e8-aea1-54e1ada290c0\ndiff --git a/.gitattributes b/.gitattributes\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..af926ef\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.gitattributes\n@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@\n+* annex.backend=MD5E\n+**/.git* annex.largefiles=nothing\n```\n\nYou can tweak the annex settings as you see fit (and `create` has options for controlling what settings are used in the first place).\n\nAlso note that most datalad commands should work fine on a git-annex repo  (and those that don't should fail in an informative way).","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"607ac2a9afabc0e44debe80e34283e413e009770"},"timestamp":1531404443,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE3MzA0MDQ2NzM="},"added":["question"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"036ecaacf834cfcd42319503b489e45cd910eea4"},"timestamp":1531654966,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwNTA4NTQ4MA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2694#issuecomment-405085480"},"message":"Cool, this seemed to work fine on my repo (feel free to close this if need be).","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1531675853,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwNTEwNTc3NQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2694#issuecomment-405105775"},"message":"Feel welcome to ask more @aragilar ;-)","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1531675853,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTczNDI4MTQ5MQ=="},"status":2}]}